  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KGNDF - Enhancing resilient rural communities through decentralized water and waste infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project delivers demand-led technical assistance to the Mexican National Water Commission (CONAGUA) to access GCF Project Preparation Funding (PPF) for the development of a detailed Funding Proposal to finance decentralized water and waste management infrastructure for rural communities vulnerable to water scarcity.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project delivers demand-led technical assistance to the Mexican National Water Commission (CONAGUA) to access GCF Project Preparation Funding (PPF) for the development of a detailed Funding Proposal to finance decentralized water and waste management infrastructure for rural communities vulnerable to water scarcity.</narrative>
  </description>
